      "value": "https://booth.pm/en/items/5991591\n\nthis free unity tool creates a duplicate of the mesh and has it weighted to the same bones with the normals flipped (it makes an outline mesh for quest basically). You can animate the colors by animating on the outline mesh. (you can't animate the thickness but you can do everything else). VRChat should do this but in the meantime this tool is very useful.",
