  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Allow the Toon Standard Outline variant to be uploaded and used on the Android platform, but in turn the doubled polygon count should be included in the avatar statistics and affect the performance ranking.\n\nThis would allow avatar creators can easily add an outline to their Android avatars without editing the mesh, keep parity with the PC version of the avatar, and allows for the animation of outline color and thickness on Android.",
